# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# This repository tracks SOURCE CODE ONLY.
#
# Research data, model weights, generated results, and the unpublished
# manuscript are deliberately excluded. Anything committed here is permanently
# recoverable from git history once the repository is made public, so keep
# unpublished data out.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Local µm-per-pixel calibration written by the semi-automatic editor — specific
